{
  "stance": "neutral",
  "view": "Mixed read. Q2 billings rose 13% YoY to ₹1,559.3 crore, but Shiksha fell 27.2% and the stock slipped 3% on the update. Analysts stayed positive: 20 of 22 rate it Buy, with Kotak upgrading to Buy at a ₹1,400 target. The recruitment growth of 12.6% was held back by one-off renewal deferrals, which management puts at 14-15% adjusted.",
